@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@customerId = 1
# 创建后将返回的 data.id 填入 customerId；客户不受商品读取可见性规则影响。

### 创建客户：元数据必填校验
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/customer/create
Content-Type: application/json

{"payload": {"displayName": "CRUD 示例客户", "email": "crud@example.com"}}

### 更新客户：主键用于定位，不允许改写
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/customer/update
Content-Type: application/json

{"payload": {"id": {{customerId}}, "displayName": "已更新客户"}}

### 分页查询：过滤、排序与分页
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/customer/page
Content-Type: application/json

{"options": {"filter": {"id": {{customerId}}}, "page": 1, "limit": 10, "sorts": [{"field": "id", "direction": "DESC"}]}}

### 查询详情：返回实体字段名
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/customer/detail
Content-Type: application/json

{"options": {"resultMode": "ENTITY", "filter": {"id": {{customerId}}}}}

### 删除客户：仅使用本场景创建、未关联订单的客户
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ent-crud/customer/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{"payload": {"id": {{customerId}}}}
